            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Paul the Apostle</strong><br>\nPaul, known as Saul of Tarsus before his conversion to Christianity, was born around the year 5 AD in Tarsus, in modern-day Turkey. As a Roman citizen and a Jew, he was well-educated, particularly in the study of the Jewish law and tradition. Paul spoke Greek and had the privilege of receiving a diverse cultural education, which later played a significant role in his missionary journeys and the writing of his epistles.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Conversion to Christianity</strong><br>\nPaul's conversion to Christianity is one of the most significant events in Christian history. Originally a persecutor of Christians, he experienced a profound spiritual transformation after seeing a blinding light and hearing the voice of Jesus on the road to Damascus. This event, which led to his blindness for three days, ended with Paul being baptized and regaining his sight.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Missionary Journeys</strong><br>\nAfter his conversion, Paul became a missionary, spreading the Christian faith across the Roman Empire. He undertook several missionary journeys throughout the Mediterranean, reaching out to both Jews and Gentiles. His travels included visits to Cyprus, Asia Minor, Greece, and eventually Rome, founding Christian communities and providing guidance to them through his letters.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
